# {{ name }}

Organization-owned laboratory implementation built on OpenSDL.

## Start locally

```bash
uv sync
uv run opensdl validate opensdl.yaml \
  --workflow workflows/first-run.yaml \
  --workflow workflows/manual-check.yaml
uv run opensdl doctor --manifest opensdl.yaml
uv run opensdl run workflows/first-run.yaml \
  --manifest opensdl.yaml \
  --inputs '{"red_fraction":0.5,"blue_fraction":0.5,"sample_id":"demo","total_mass_g":5}'
```

